1
00:00:00,282 --> 00:00:01,717
Saat pintu lift terbuka,

2
00:00:01,717 --> 00:00:03,092
lihat celah bawahnya:

3
00:00:03,092 --> 00:00:05,036
ada dua pasang pintu terpisah

4
00:00:05,036 --> 00:00:06,471
yang bergerak serempak.

5
00:00:06,982 --> 00:00:08,790
Satu menempel di sangkar kabin,

6
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:10,843
sedangkan pintu luar menempel tetap

7
00:00:10,843 --> 00:00:12,158
pada tembok tiap lantai.

8
00:00:12,617 --> 00:00:14,207
Tanpa pengunci otomatis,

9
00:00:14,207 --> 00:00:15,991
pintu lantai bisa terbuka ke

10
00:00:15,991 --> 00:00:17,581
ruang luncur kosong yang amat

11
00:00:17,581 --> 00:00:18,278
berbahaya.

12
00:00:19,056 --> 00:00:20,949
Maka pintu luar tidak bermotor

13
00:00:20,949 --> 00:00:22,871
sendiri, melainkan dikunci kait

14
00:00:22,871 --> 00:00:25,166
mekanis interlock dari dalam sangkar.

15
00:00:25,622 --> 00:00:27,810
Hanya saat sangkar sejajar lantai,

16
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,903
bilah kabin mengait roda kunci

17
00:00:29,903 --> 00:00:32,186
lalu menyeret pintu luar terbuka.

18
00:00:32,581 --> 00:00:35,278
Batasnya, pemeriksaan kait dan sensor

19
00:00:35,278 --> 00:00:38,259
wajib mengikuti standar keselamatan

20
00:00:38,259 --> 00:00:39,252
lift ASME A17.1.

21
00:00:39,547 --> 00:00:41,268
Pernah sadar dua lapis pintu

22
00:00:41,268 --> 00:00:42,701
ini? Tulis di komentar,

23
00:00:42,701 --> 00:00:44,221
dan tekan tombol putih di

24
00:00:44,221 --> 00:00:45,741
bawah agar dapat hal yang

25
00:00:45,741 --> 00:00:46,515
gak disangka!

